return ['x-generator'=>'GlotPress/4.0.3','translation-revision-date'=>'2025-12-03 06:35:01+0000','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','project-id-version'=>'Plugins - Health Check &amp; Troubleshooting - Stable (latest release)','language'=>'zh_TW','messages'=>['The Troubleshooting Mode from the Health Check plugin will be available as a standalone plugin in the future, since the primary Health Check features have been available in WordPress since version 5.2.'=>'由於從 WordPress 5.2 開始內建這個外掛的 [網站狀態] 功能，因此這個外掛的 [疑難排解模式] 將來會以獨立外掛的方式發佈。','The additional tools for the Health Check plugin will be available as a standalone plugin in the future, since the primary Health Check features have been available in WordPress since version 5.2.'=>'由於從 WordPress 5.2 開始內建這個外掛的 [網站狀態] 功能，因此這個外掛的附加工具將來會以獨立外掛的方式發佈。','Published on %s'=>'擷取日期: %s','Delete screenshot'=>'刪除螢幕擷圖','Copy forum markup'=>'複製可用於論壇的標記','View screenshot'=>'檢視螢幕擷圖','You have not taken any screenshots, return here when you have to view them.'=>'目前尚未擷取任何螢幕擷圖，需要檢視螢幕擷圖時請返回這個頁面。','Description of the button labelTake Screenshot'=>'擷取螢幕擷圖','To take a screenshot for sharing with support users, you may click the %s button, found at the top of every page, and they will be stored securely on your site until you wish to share them.'=>'如需擷取螢幕擷圖分享給提出技術支援的使用者，請點擊頁面頂端的 [%s] 按鈕；在將螢幕擷圖分享給其他使用者前，這些已擷取的螢幕擷圖會安全的儲存於網站中。','This is a beta-feature, and some inconsistencies in screenshots is to be expected, please keep that, and the fact that your pages may show sensitive information in mind when sharing screenshots.'=>'這是 Beta 測試版功能。請注意，透過這項功能所擷取的螢幕擷圖可能會出現與預期狀況不一致之處，並且可能會在分享螢幕擷圖時一併顯示頁面中的敏感性資訊。','If you wish to troubleshoot as another user, or as an anonymous site visitor, the <a href="https://wordpress.org/plugins/user-switching/">User Switcher plugin</a> allows for all of this while also being compatible with Troubleshooting Mode.'=>'如果需要以其他使用者或匿名網站訪客的身分進行疑難排解，可以使用 <a href="https://tw.wordpress.org/plugins/user-switching/" target="_blank">User Switcher</a> 外掛，而且這個外掛與 [疑難排解模式] 相容。','Your site is using the virtual <code>robots.txt</code> file which is generated by WordPress.'=>'這個網站使用由 WordPress 產生的虛擬 <code>robots.txt</code> 檔案。','The <code>robots.txt</code> file tells search engines which directories are allowed to be crawled and which not. WordPress generates a virtual file if there is no physical file. If there is a non-virtual file, the content will be displayed here.'=>'<code>robots.txt</code> 檔案會通知搜尋引擎哪個目錄是否可供檢索。如果網站沒有 robots.txt 實體檔案，便會由 WordPress 產生虛擬檔案。當網站有非虛擬檔案時，檔案內容便會在這裡顯示。','robots.txt Viewer'=>'robots.txt 檢視器','The e-mail took a while to send; this may indicate that your server is really busy, or that the sending of emails may be experiencing other unexpected issues. If you experience continued issues, consider reaching out to your hosting provider.'=>'需要一點時間才能傳送電子郵件，這代表伺服器目前非常忙碌，或傳送電子郵件遇到無預期的問題。如果問題持續發生，請聯絡這個網站的主機服務提供商。','This is an unknown file'=>'這是未知的檔案。','Debug log contents'=>'偵錯記錄內容','https://wordpress.org/documentation/article/debugging-in-wordpress/#wp_debug_log'=>'https://wordpress.org/documentation/article/debugging-in-wordpress/#wp_debug_log','You can read more about the <code>WP_DEBUG_LOG</code> constant, and how to enable it, in the <a href="%s">Debugging in WordPress</a> article.'=>'網站管理員可以在〈<a href="%s" target="_blank">WordPress 的偵錯功能</a>〉一文中進一步了解 <code>WP_DEBUG_LOG</code> 常數及其啟用方式。','Because the <code>WP_DEBUG_LOG</code> constant is not set to allow logging of errors and warnings, and there is therefore no more details here.'=>'由於 <code>WP_DEBUG_LOG</code> 常數尚未設定為允許記錄錯誤及警告訊息，因此無法在這裡顯示更多詳細資訊。','The debug log file found at `%s`, could not be read.'=>'無法讀取在 %s 找到的偵錯記錄檔案。','The details below are gathered from your <code>debug.log</code> file, and is displayed because the <code>WP_DEBUG_LOG</code> constant has been set to allow logging of warnings and errors.'=>'將常數 <code>WP_DEBUG_LOG</code> 設定為允許記錄網站產生的警告及錯誤訊息後，這裡便會顯示來自 <code>debug.log</code> 檔案的詳細資訊。','Debug logs'=>'偵錯記錄','Disable beta features'=>'停用 Beta 測試版功能','Enable beta features'=>'啟用 Beta 測試版功能','The plugin may contain beta features, which you as the site owner can enable or disable as you wish.'=>'這個外掛包含 Beta 測試版功能，網站擁有者可依照需求啟用或停用這些功能。','Beta features'=>'Beta 測試版功能','Take screenshot'=>'擷取螢幕擷圖','Screenshot'=>'螢幕擷圖','Screenshots'=>'螢幕擷圖','Cancel'=>'取消','Confirm'=>'確認','You were attempting to perform an action that requires a security token, which was either not present in your request, or was considered invalid. Please verify that the following action is intentional, or feel free to cancel the action and nothing will change.'=>'正在嘗試執行的動作需要安全性權杖，但這個要求沒有使用安全性權杖或使用了無效的安全性權杖。請驗證所列動作是有意為之，或隨時取消這個動作、不會產生任何變更。','Troubleshooting Mode - Security check'=>'疑難排解模式 - 安全性檢查','You were attempting to <strong>change the active theme</strong> to %s while troubleshooting.'=>'在進行疑難排解時嘗試<strong>變更目前使用的佈景主題</strong>為 %s。','You were attempting to <strong>disable</strong> the %s plugin while troubleshooting.'=>'在進行疑難排解時嘗試<strong>停用</strong> %s 外掛。','You were attempting to <strong>enable</strong> the %s plugin while troubleshooting.'=>'在進行疑難排解時嘗試<strong>啟用</strong> %s 外掛。','You were attempting to <strong>dismiss all notices</strong>.'=>'正在嘗試<strong>關閉全部通知</strong>。','You were attempting to <strong>disable Troubleshooting Mode</strong>.'=>'正在嘗試<strong>停用 [疑難排解模式]</strong>。','Install the latest classic default theme'=>'安裝最新的預設傳統佈景主題','Install the latest default theme'=>'安裝最新的預設佈景主題','Your site is not using <code>.htaccess</code> to handle permalinks. This means that your .htaccess file is not being used to handle requests, and they are most likely handled directly by your web-server software.'=>'這個網站沒有使用 <code>.htaccess</code> 規則處理永久連結，這代表這個網站的 .htaccess 檔案並未用於處理要求，很可能是這個網站的網頁伺服器直接處理相關要求。','Your site is using <code>.htaccess</code> rules to handle permalinks, but no .htaccess file was found. This means that your .htaccess file is not being used to handle requests.'=>'這個網站使用 <code>.htaccess</code> 規則處理永久連結，但是找不到 .htaccess 檔案。這代表這個網站的 .htaccess 檔案並未用於處理要求。','The <code>.htaccess</code> file tells your server (if supported) how to handle links and file requests. This file usually requires direct server access to view, but if your system supports these files, you can verify its content here.'=>'<code>.htaccess</code> 會告知這個網站的伺服器 (如果支援) 處理連結及檔案要求的方式。這個檔案通常需要直接存取伺服器能才能檢視，但如果系統支援這些檔案，就可以在這裡直接驗證檔案的內容。','.htaccess Viewer'=>'.htaccess 檢視器','The plugin itself still offers you the ability to troubleshoot issues with your installation, and various tools associated with this functionality.'=>'這個外掛仍會提供 WordPress 網站的疑難排解功能，以及疑難排解功能的相關工具。','Due to this, some functionality has been removed from the plugin, you can find these features in a more recent version of WordPress it self.'=>'由於這個原因，某些功能已從這個外掛移除，網站管理員可以在較新版本的 WordPress 中使用這些功能。','You are running an older version of WordPress, version %s. The Site Health features from this plugin were added to version 5.2 of WordPress.'=>'這個網站目前執行的是版本較舊的 WordPress %s。這個網站的 [網站狀態] 功能已於 WordPress 5.2 時內建至核心程式中。','WordPress update needed!'=>'WordPress 必須更新','The Health Check plugin will attempt to disable cache solutions on your site, but if you are using a custom caching solution, you may need to disable it manually when troubleshooting.'=>'Health Check 外掛會嘗試停用這個網站上的快取解決方案，如果這個網站使用自訂快取方案，網站管理員需要在進行疑難排解時手動停用快取解決方案。','Switch anyway'=>'直接切換','Force-switch to the %s theme, even though the loopback checks failed.'=>'即使回送檢查失敗，仍然強制切換至 %s 佈景主題。','Disable anyway'=>'直接停用','Force-disable the plugin, %s, even though the loopback checks failed.'=>'即使回送檢查失敗，仍然強制停用 %s 外掛。','Enable anyway'=>'直接啟用','Force-enable the plugin, %s, even though the loopback checks failed.'=>'即使回送檢查失敗，仍然強制啟用 %s 外掛。','The slug, or version, is missing from the request.'=>'這個要求缺少代稱或版本。','PHP Info'=>'PHP 資訊','Database collation'=>'資料庫定序','Database charset'=>'資料庫字元集','Table prefix'=>'資料表前置詞','Database username'=>'資料庫使用者名稱','Are pretty permalinks supported?'=>'是否支援易於辨識的永久連結','Max number of files allowed'=>'單次上傳檔案數量上限','Max effective file size'=>'有效檔案大小上限','Max size of an uploaded file'=>'上傳單一檔案大小上限','Max size of post data allowed'=>'單次上傳全部檔案大小總計上限','File uploads'=>'檔案上傳','File upload settings'=>'檔案上傳設定','Drop-ins are single files, found in the %s directory, that replace or enhance WordPress features in ways that are not possible for traditional plugins.'=>'檔案位置在 %s 目錄的強化外掛，是用來取代或加強 WordPress 無法透過傳統外掛加入功能的獨立檔案。','Environment type'=>'環境類型','Is this site discouraging search engines?'=>'這個網站是否阻擋搜尋引擎進行索引','The %s constant is no longer supported.'=>'常數 %s 已不再支援。','Highest supported PHP'=>'PHP 最高支援版本','Minimum PHP'=>'PHP 最低版本需求','Plugin'=>'外掛名稱','Could not be determined'=>'無法確認','Check plugins'=>'檢查外掛相容性','The compatibility check will need to send requests to the <a href="https://wptide.org">WPTide</a> project to fetch the test results for each of your plugins.'=>'相容性檢查需要傳送要求至 <a href="https://wptide.org" target="_blank">WPTide</a> 專案，以便擷取這個網站上的外掛測試結果。','Attempt to identify the compatibility of your plugins before upgrading PHP, note that a compatibility check may not always be accurate, and you may want to contact the plugin author to confirm that things will continue working.'=>'在更新 PHP 前，請先檢查這個網站已安裝外掛的相容性。請注意，相容性檢查結果不保證完全正確，網站管理員或許需要聯絡外掛開發者以確認外掛在升級 PHP 後仍可正常運作。','Plugin compatibility'=>'外掛相容性檢查','Inactive Themes'=>'未啟用的佈景主題','Parent Theme'=>'上層佈景主題','Timezone'=>'時區','This page can show you every detail about the configuration of your WordPress website. For any improvements that could be made, see the <a href="%s">Site Health Status</a> page.'=>'這個頁面顯示 WordPress 網站組態的各項詳細資料。網站如有需要改進的項目，請參照 [<a href="%s">網站狀態</a>] 頁面所列資訊進行。','Show %d remaining theme'=>'顯示其他 %d 個佈景主題','Show %d remaining plugin'=>'顯示其他 %d 個外掛','When bulk-disabling plugins, a site failure occurred. Because of this the change was automatically reverted.'=>'批次停用外掛後，這個網站便發生錯誤，因此這項變更已自動還原。','When bulk-enabling plugins, a site failure occurred. Because of this the change was automatically reverted.'=>'批次啟用外掛後，這個網站便發生錯誤，因此這項變更已自動還原。','When enabling troubleshooting on the selected plugins, a site failure occurred. Because of this the selected plugins were kept disabled while troubleshooting mode started.'=>'為選取的外掛啟用疑難排解功能後，這個網站便發生錯誤，因此在 [疑難排解模式] 中會繼續停用這些外掛。','Extended PHP Information'=>'完整 PHP 資訊','The Site Health check requires JavaScript.'=>'[網站狀態檢查] 功能需要 JavaScript。','Secondary menu'=>'次要選單','Site Health'=>'網站狀態','View extended PHP information'=>'檢視完整 PHP 資訊','Copied!'=>'已完成複製！','Copy site info to clipboard'=>'複製網站狀態資訊至剪貼簿','If you want to export a handy list of all the information on this page, you can use the button below to copy it to the clipboard. You can then paste it in a text file and save it to your device, or paste it in an email exchange with a support engineer or theme/plugin developer for example.'=>'如果網站管理員想要將這個頁面的全部資訊匯出為方便使用的清單，請點擊下方按鈕便能將資訊複製至剪貼簿中。舉例來說，網站管理員可以將這些資訊貼上至文字檔案並儲存於裝置的儲存空間，或是將這些資訊貼上至與技術支援工程師、佈景主題/外掛開發者交換意見的電子郵件中。','Site Health Info'=>'網站狀態資訊','Troubleshooting mode'=>'疑難排解模式','Theme directory location'=>'佈景主題安裝目錄位置','Theme features'=>'佈景主題特色','None'=>'不使用','Is SUHOSIN installed?'=>'主機是否已安裝 SUHOSIN','PHP version'=>'PHP 版本','Web server'=>'網頁伺服器軟體','ImageMagick version string'=>'ImageMagick 版本字串','ImageMagick version number'=>'ImageMagick 版本號碼','Shows whether WordPress is able to write to the directories it needs access to.'=>'下列資訊顯示 WordPress 是否能對需要存取的目錄進行寫入。','These settings alter where and how parts of WordPress are loaded.'=>'下列常數及其設定值會更改 WordPress 的載入位置及方式。','Directories and Sizes'=>'目錄位置及大小','comment statusClosed'=>'已關閉','comment statusOpen'=>'已啟用','No permalink structure set'=>'尚未設定永久連結結構','User Language'=>'使用者偏好的介面語言','Site Language'=>'網站介面語言','localized PHP upgrade information pagehttps://wordpress.org/support/update-php/'=>'https://wordpress.org/support/update-php/','Error'=>'發生錯誤','Once weekly'=>'每週一次','Info'=>'網站資訊','Page titleSite Health'=>'網站狀態','Menu TitleSite Health %s'=>'網站狀態 %s','Issue counter label for the admin menuCritical issues'=>'個重大問題','The loopback request returned an unexpected http status code, %d, it was not possible to determine if this will prevent features from working as expected.'=>'回送要求傳回未預期的 HTTP 狀態代碼 %d，因此無法確定這是否會導致各項功能無法如預期般運作。','The loopback request to your site failed, this means features relying on them are not currently working as expected.'=>'這個網站的回送要求無法完成，這代表依靠回送要求的功能目前無法如預期般運作。','Notices (%d)'=>'注意事項數量: %d','Available themes (%d)'=>'可供使用的佈景主題數量: %d','Available plugins (%d)'=>'可供使用的外掛數量: %d','enabled'=>'已啟用','Troubleshooting Mode - %s'=>'疑難排解模式 - %s','Prefix for inactive themes in troubleshooting modeSwitch to'=>'切換至','Prefix for the active theme in troubleshooting modeActive:'=>'目前使用的佈景主題:','You do not have access to this file.'=>'目前的登入身分沒有存取這個檔案的權限。','(Does not support 64bit values)'=>'(不支援 64 位元值)','Unable to determine what web server software is used'=>'無法確認這個網站所採用的網頁伺服器軟體','Additional message from admin: %s'=>'來自網站管理員的附加訊息：%s','Hi! This test message was sent by the Health Check plugin from %1$s (%2$s) on %3$s at %4$s. Since you’re reading this, it obviously works.'=>'你好，這封測試用電子郵件由《%1$s》(網址為 %2$s) 的 Health Check 外掛所傳送，傳送時間為 %3$s %4$s。能閱讀到這封電子郵件的內容，就代表這個網站傳送電子郵件的功能運作正常。','Health Check & Troubleshooting'=>'Health Check & Troubleshooting','You have successfully enabled Troubleshooting Mode, all plugins will appear inactive until you disable Troubleshooting Mode, or log out and back in again.'=>'已成功啟用 [疑難排解模式]，全部外掛均會先行停用，直到停用這個模式或登出網站並再次登入。','Active theme: %s'=>'目前使用的佈景主題: %s','Waiting...'=>'等待中...','Switch to this theme'=>'切換至這個佈景主題','Switch the active theme to %s'=>'切換至佈景主題 %s','Enable'=>'啟用','Enable the plugin, %s, while troubleshooting.'=>'在疑難排解模式中啟用 %s 外掛。','Disable'=>'停用','Disable the plugin, %s, while troubleshooting.'=>'在疑難排解模式中停用 %s 外掛。','Dismiss notices'=>'關閉注意事項','Plugin actions, such as activating and deactivating, are not available while in Troubleshooting Mode.'=>'啟用 [疑難排解模式] 後，便無法為外掛進行批次操作，例如啟用與停用。','There are no notices to show.'=>'沒有可供顯示的注意事項。','Here you can enable individual plugins or themes, helping you to find out what might be causing strange behaviors on your site. Do note that <strong>any changes you make to settings will be kept</strong> when you disable Troubleshooting Mode.'=>'啟用這項功能的網站管理員可以在這裡為外掛或佈景主題進行個別啟用，這樣便能找出導致網站上出現奇怪行為的原因。請注意，停用疑難排解模式後，將<strong>保留啟用期間所進行的全部變更</strong>。','Your site is currently in Troubleshooting Mode. This has <strong>no effect on your site visitors</strong>, they will continue to view your site as usual, but for you it will look as if you had just installed WordPress for the first time.'=>'這個網站目前啟用了疑難排解模式。這個模式<strong>不會影響網站訪客</strong>，網站訪客檢視網站的結果一如往常，但啟用這項功能的網站管理員會看到 WordPress 網站回復成有如第一次安裝後的樣子。','When switching the active theme to %1$s, a site failure occurred. Because of this we reverted the theme to the one you used previously. %2$s'=>'將佈景主題切換至 %1$s 後，這個網站便發生錯誤，因此系統已將佈景主題還原至之前使用的佈景主題。%2$s','When disabling the plugin, %1$s, a site failure occurred. Because of this the change was automatically reverted. %2$s'=>'停用了代稱為 %1$s 的外掛後，這個網站便發生錯誤，因此這項變更已自動還原。%2$s','When enabling the plugin, %1$s, a site failure occurred. Because of this the change was automatically reverted. %2$s'=>'啟用了代稱為 %1$s 的外掛後，這個網站便發生錯誤，因此這項變更已自動還原。%2$s','We could not remove the old must-use plugin.'=>'這個外掛無法移除舊版強制使用外掛。','Send test mail'=>'傳送測試郵件','Additional message'=>'附加訊息','Health Check – Test Message from %s'=>'Health Check 外掛 – 來自 %s 的測試訊息','One possible reason for this may be that your installation contains translated versions. An easy way to clear this is to reinstall WordPress. Don\'t worry. This will only affect WordPress\' own files, not your themes, plugins or uploaded media.'=>'其中一個可能的原因是這個網站為本地化版本，而要排除這個原因的方法，最簡單的方式為重新安裝 WordPress。不必擔心，這項操作只會影響 WordPress 核心程式的檔案，而不會對佈景主題、外掛及已上傳的媒體檔案造成任何影響。','Your %s file contains only core WordPress features.'=>'這個網站的 %s 檔案僅包含 WordPress 核心程式功能。','Custom rules have been added to your %s file.'=>'自訂規則已加入這個網站的 %s 檔案中。','.htaccess rules'=>'.htaccess 規則','Not available'=>'主機不提供這項功能','(Latest version: %s)'=>'(目前最新版本為 %s 版)','Active:'=>'已啟用:','Themes'=>'佈景主題','Modified'=>'修改版本','Original'=>'原始版本','Email'=>'電子郵件地址','The Mail Check will invoke the <code>wp_mail()</code> function and check if it succeeds. We will use the E-mail address you have set up, but you can change it below if you like.'=>'[傳送郵件功能檢查] 會叫用 <code>wp_mail()</code> 函式並檢查郵件是否傳送成功。外掛會使用目前進行操作的使用者的電子郵件地址，但可於下方欄位進行變更。','Mail Check'=>'傳送郵件功能檢查','Check the Files Integrity'=>'檢查檔案完整性','The File Integrity checks all the core files with the <code>checksums</code> provided by the WordPress API to see if they are intact. If there are changes you will be able to make a Diff between the files hosted on WordPress.org and your installation to see what has been changed.'=>'檔案完整性檢查使用 WordPress 提供的 <code>checksums</code> API 檢查全部核心程式檔案，以查看它們是否未經修改。如果有任何變更，網站管理員便能將代管於 WordPress.org 上的檔案與這個網站的檔案進行差異比對，以查看變更的內容。','File integrity'=>'檔案完整性檢查','cURL version'=>'cURL 版本','It seems there was a problem sending the e-mail.'=>'傳送電子郵件時發生問題。','We have just sent an e-mail using <code>wp_mail()</code> and it seems to work. Please check your inbox and spam folder to see if you received it.'=>'外掛已透過 <code>wp_mail()</code> 函式傳送一封測試電子郵件，這個函式功能看來運作無誤，請至收件匣或垃圾郵件資料夾查看是否收到這封測試郵件。','Result from testing without any plugins active and a default theme'=>'不啟用任何外掛及使用預設佈景主題的測試結果','Reason'=>'原因','File'=>'檔案','Status'=>'狀態','It appears as if some files may have been modified.'=>'檢查結果顯示，有些檔案可能經過修改。','All files passed the check. Everything seems to be ok!'=>'全部檔案均通過檢查，一切如常。','File not found'=>'找不到檔案','(View Diff)'=>'(檢視差異)','Content changed'=>'內容已變更','Tools'=>'工具','Disable Troubleshooting Mode'=>'停用疑難排解模式','You don\'t have any of the default themes installed. A default theme helps you determine if your current theme is causing conflicts.'=>'這個網站並未安裝任何預設佈景主題。預設佈景主題可以協助網站管理員確認使用中的佈景主題是否為造成衝突的原因。','Menu, Section and Page TitleHealth Check'=>'網站狀態檢查','Enable %s'=>'啟用 %s','Disable %s'=>'停用 %s','Manage active plugins'=>'管理已安裝的外掛','Enable while troubleshooting'=>'在疑難排解模式中啟用','Disable while troubleshooting'=>'在疑難排解模式中停用','A Troubleshooting Mode menu is added to your admin bar, which will allow you to enable plugins individually, switch back to your current theme, and disable Troubleshooting Mode.'=>'啟用 [疑難排除模式] 後，它會工具列上新增一個選單，啟用這個模式的網站管理員，便能使用新增的選單為外掛進行個別啟用、切換至網站目前使用的佈景主題及停用 [疑難排解模式]。','By enabling the Troubleshooting Mode, all plugins will appear inactive and your site will switch to the default theme only for you. All other users will see your site as usual.'=>'對啟用 [疑難排解模式] 這項功能的網站管理員來說，網站上全部外掛均會停用，並切換至預設佈景主題，但其他網站訪客檢視網站則一切如常。','When troubleshooting issues on your site, you are likely to be told to disable all plugins and switch to the default theme.'=>'一般來說，在為網站進行疑難排解時，都會要求網站管理員停用全部外掛並切換到預設佈景主題。','Error encountered: (%1$d) %2$s'=>'遇到的錯誤: (%1$d) %2$s','Database name'=>'資料庫名稱','Max input time'=>'輸入資料剖析時間上限','Ghostscript version'=>'Ghostscript 版本','Unable to determine if Ghostscript is installed'=>'無法確認主機是否安裝了 Ghostscript','GD version'=>'GD 版本','Imagick Resource Limits'=>'Imagick 資源限制','Active editor'=>'網站啟用的編輯器','Media Handling'=>'媒體處理','Troubleshoot'=>'疑難排解','Return to the Dashboard'=>'返回 [控制台]','We were unable to replace the plugin file required to enable the Troubleshooting Mode.'=>'這個外掛無法取代啟用 [疑難排解模式] 所需的外掛檔案。','Enable Troubleshooting Mode'=>'啟用疑難排解模式','Plugins'=>'外掛','Troubleshooting Mode'=>'疑難排解模式','Please note, that due to how Must Use plugins work, any such plugin will not be disabled for the troubleshooting session.'=>'請注意，由於「強制使用外掛」的執行方式不同，因此在 [疑難排解模式] 中無法停用這類外掛。','Understandably, you do not wish to do so as it may affect your site visitors, leaving them with lost functionality.'=>'可以理解多數的網站管理員均不希望這樣做，因為這項操作會影響網站訪客，使他們瀏覽沒有原先功能的網站。','We were unable to copy the plugin file required to enable the Troubleshooting Mode.'=>'這個外掛無法複製啟用 [疑難排解模式] 所需的外掛檔案。','We were unable to create the mu-plugins directory.'=>'這個外掛無法建立 mu-plugins 目錄。','Troubleshooting'=>'疑難排解','The loopback request to your site completed successfully.'=>'這個網站的回送要求已成功完成。','Version %s'=>'%s 版','By %s'=>'開發者為 %s','No version or author information is available.'=>'沒有可用的版本或開發者資訊。','(Supports 64bit values)'=>'(支援 64 位元值)','The WordPress.org community'=>'The WordPress.org community','Checks the health of your WordPress install.'=>'為 WordPress 網站進行狀態檢查。','https://wordpress.org/plugins/health-check/'=>'https://tw.wordpress.org/plugins/health-check/','Some scenarios require you to look up more detailed server configurations than what is normally required. The PHP Info page allows you to view all available configuration options for your PHP setup. Please be advised that WordPress does not guarantee that any information shown on that page may not be considered sensitive.'=>'某些狀況會要求網站管理員提供比一般所需更詳細的伺服器設定資料，而 [PHP 資訊] 頁面能讓網站管理員檢視目前網站主機 PHP 環境中全部可用的設定及其設定值。請注意，WordPress 不保證顯示於這個頁面的資訊，其他第三方不會視為敏感性資訊。','The phpinfo() function has been disabled by your host. Please contact the host if you need more information about your setup.'=>'這個網站的主機停用了 phpinfo() 函式。如果需要進一步了解這個網站的設定資訊，請聯絡網站主機服務商。','%1$s (%2$s)'=>'%1$s (%2$s)','Parent theme'=>'上層佈景主題','Author website'=>'開發者網站','Author'=>'開發者','Name'=>'名稱','Version %1$s by %2$s'=>'%1$s 版，開發者為 %2$s','Database host'=>'資料庫主機','Client version'=>'用戶端版本','Server version'=>'伺服器版本','Extension'=>'擴充功能','Is the Imagick library available?'=>'主機是否提供 Imagick 程式庫','PHP post max size'=>'PHP 單次上傳檔案大小總計上限','Upload max filesize'=>'單一檔案上傳大小上限','PHP memory limit'=>'PHP 可存取的記憶體上限','PHP time limit'=>'PHP 執行時間上限','PHP max input variables'=>'PHP 輸入變數上限','Unable to determine some settings, as the %s function has been disabled.'=>'無法確認某些設定 (例如 %s 函式) 是否遭到停用','Server settings'=>'伺服器設定','Unable to determine PHP SAPI'=>'無法確認主機上的 PHP SAPI 版本','PHP SAPI'=>'PHP SAPI','Unable to determine PHP version'=>'無法確認主機上的 PHP 版本','Unable to determine server architecture'=>'無法確認主機的伺服器架構','Server architecture'=>'伺服器架構','Unable to reach WordPress.org at %1$s: %2$s'=>'這個網站無法連線至位於 %1$s 的 WordPress.org (%2$s)','WordPress.org is reachable'=>'這個網站可順利連線至 WordPress.org。','Communication with WordPress.org'=>'與 WordPress.org 間的通訊狀況','Network count'=>'多站網路數量','Site count'=>'網站數量','User count'=>'可登入使用者人數','The must use plugins directory'=>'mu-plugins 目錄','The themes directory'=>'themes 目錄','The plugins directory'=>'plugins 目錄','The uploads directory'=>'uploads 目錄','The wp-content directory'=>'wp-content 目錄','Not writable'=>'不可寫入','Writable'=>'可寫入','The main WordPress directory'=>'WordPress 主目錄','Filesystem Permissions'=>'檔案系統權限','Disabled'=>'已停用','Enabled'=>'已啟用','Undefined'=>'未定義','WordPress Constants'=>'WordPress 常數','Database'=>'資料庫','The options shown below relate to your server setup. If changes are required, you may need your web host&#8217;s assistance.'=>'這個網站的伺服器設定值已顯示於下方。如需變更，請洽詢網站主機服務商要求提供協助。','Server'=>'伺服器','Inactive Plugins'=>'未啟用的外掛','Active Plugins'=>'已啟用的外掛','Must Use Plugins'=>'強制使用的外掛','Active Theme'=>'目前使用的佈景主題','Drop-ins'=>'強化外掛','Is this a multisite?'=>'是否為多站網路','Default comment status'=>'預設留言狀態','Can anyone register on this site?'=>'這個網站是否開放註冊','No'=>'否','Yes'=>'是','Is this site using HTTPS?'=>'這個網站是否使用 HTTPS','Permalink structure'=>'永久連結結構','Site URL'=>'網站網址','Home URL'=>'首頁網址','Version'=>'版本','WordPress'=>'WordPress']];